8. How do you analyze and troubleshoot a system that is running slowly?
Ans: Check the cpu/mem stats, io stat ,load average stats. If any process is consuming the mem/cpu
 we will kill it.  
A high load average does not automatically mean high I/O.Load average includes processes that are:
Running or waiting for CPU
Waiting in uninterruptible sleep (D state), commonly due to I/O.
